=2 Walkthrough
* Note that **the following fight is considerably more difficult** than the content leading up to it. If solo (with up to four {p:Trusts|Trust}) you may want to reach level 40 to level 50 before attempting.
* Examine the {p:Undulating Confluence} again to start the battle.
** Killing {m:Ophiotaurus} by Calling For Help is permitted. The option to do this is next to the combat menu button to Disengage.
** The monster will spawn and attack you as soon as you click the {p:Undulating Confluence} for the second time, so make sure you already have your trusts out.
** You fight against {m:Ophiotaurus}. See its page for more information.
** The {p:Undulating Confluence} doesn't disappear, but only one party can have {m:Ophiotaurus} popped at a time.
** The mission is automatically completed when the {m:Ophiotaurus} is defeated.
** Examine the {p:Undulating Confluence} again for a cutscene.

